                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>📷</span> Device Camera & File Attachment Pipeline
                        </h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
                            Simulates mobile camera image capture, payload compression, and SHA-256 cryptographic verification.
                        </p>
